# Neubrutal currently has no required environment variables — it's a fully
# static site with no external services, analytics, or secrets wired in.
#
# This file exists so there's an obvious place to document variables if you
# add an integration that needs them (analytics, a form backend, a CMS
# token, etc.). Prefix client-exposed values with PUBLIC_; leave server-only
# values unprefixed. See Astro's environment variables guide:
# https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/environment-variables/
